            <title>3.33.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:17:02 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>247</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.33.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The control API's `list_folders` now names this Mac's No folder (`noFolder`), so the iPhone app can start a session there without guessing the path. Opening No folder with `open_session` now creates it first on a Mac that never used it.
]]></description>
