        <item>
            <title>3.33.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:56:53 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>246</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.33.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The usage footer in the sidebar has a refresh button. It refetches the 5-hour, weekly and per-model limits for every Claude login on this Mac, and shows a warning icon with the reason when a fetch fails.

### Changes
- Usage bars now refresh every 5 minutes on their own, so they stay current while every session is idle (for example, after using the same account on another Mac or the web).
]]></description>
