        <item>
            <title>3.32.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:01:50 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>245</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.32.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The model picked in the launcher now applies only to that session. It is passed to the session's Claude Code process instead of being written to the shared `~/.claude/settings.json`, so it no longer changes other sessions or a `claude` started from a terminal. `/model` inside the session still switches it.
- Launching with Auto model or Auto effort no longer removes your own `model` or `effortLevel` (including the effort chosen in the chat panel) from `~/.claude/settings.json`. A `model` value left there by an earlier Canopy is cleaned up once.

### Bug Fixes
- Running a Canopy from inside a Canopy session no longer makes its Auto sessions inherit the outer session's model.
]]></description>
